      "description": "Forty-pixel control using decorative Lucide SVG icons and accessible button names.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-icon-button\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Перо\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m14 4 6 6-9 9-7 1 1-7Z M11 7l6 6 M4 20l4-4\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-icon-button{width:40px;height:40px;padding:0;display:inline-grid;place-items:center;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#182230);cursor:pointer;}.ds-icon-button svg{width:22px;height:22px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;}.ds-icon-button:not(:disabled):hover{background:var(--control-hover,#f1f4f8);}.ds-icon-button[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{color:var(--control-selected-text,#175cd3);background:var(--control-selected-bg,#eaf1ff);}.ds-icon-button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#175cd3);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-icon-button:disabled{color:var(--control-disabled,#86909f);cursor:default;}",
      "refersTo": "icon-button"
    },
    {
