      "kind": "button",
      "description": "Full-width recovery action in save details.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\" type=\"button\">Повторить сохранение</button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,sans-serif;width:100%;min-height:40px;padding:9px 12px;border:0;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--paper,#fff);background:var(--focus,#175cd3);cursor:pointer;}.ds-primary:not(:disabled):hover{background:#124cb1;}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#175cd3);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-primary:disabled{color:var(--control-disabled,#86909f);cursor:default;}",
