      "description": "Forty-pixel hit height with a thin track and accent thumb for width/stabilization.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-range-label\">Стабилизация<input class=\"ds-range\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"65\" aria-label=\"Стабилизация\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-range-label{font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,sans-serif;display:grid;color:var(--ink,#182230);font-size:13px;}.ds-range{appearance:none;width:100%;min-height:40px;margin:0;background:transparent;accent-color:var(--focus,#175cd3);cursor:pointer;}.ds-range::-webkit-slider-runnable-track{height:3px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--divider,#e0e5ec);}.ds-range::-webkit-slider-thumb{appearance:none;width:13px;height:13px;margin-top:-5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--focus,#175cd3);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #fff;}.ds-range:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#175cd3);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-range:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Floating Tool Dock",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Signature solid white floating toolbar: fixed 778×56px with 128px board and 190px context slots at widths >=1200px; two rows at 651–1199px (104px high, top 80px); three rows at <=650px (152px high, top 80px). The current-board chooser leads the dock with an 11px muted library label above a 14px semibold board name inside its 40px control; tools stay grouped. Image insertion feedback is visible out of flow; its notice has 10px corners.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-dock\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Инструменты доски\"><button class=\"ds-dock-tool\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Перо\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m14 4 6 6-9 9-7 1 1-7Z M11 7l6 6 M4 20l4-4\"/></svg></button><span class=\"ds-dock-divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"ds-dock-readout\">3.0 <small>px</small></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-dock{font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:56px;padding:8px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--paper,#fff);color:var(--ink,#182230);box-shadow:var(--chrome-shadow,0 3px 14px rgb(24 34 48 / 8%),0 1px 3px rgb(24 34 48 / 5%));}.ds-dock-tool{width:40px;height:40px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--control-selected-bg,#eaf1ff);color:var(--focus,#175cd3);cursor:pointer;}.ds-dock-tool svg{width:22px;height:22px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;}.ds-dock-tool:hover{background:var(--control-hover,#f1f4f8);}.ds-dock-tool:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#175cd3);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-dock-divider{width:1px;height:22px;margin:0 3px;background:var(--divider,#e0e5ec);}.ds-dock-readout{font-size:13px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.ds-dock-readout small{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted,#526176);}",
      "refersTo": "floating-dock"
    },
    {
      "name": "Menu Row",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Full-width icon/label row used in board and selection disclosures.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-menu-row\" type=\"button\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v12 m-5-5 5 5 5-5 M4 16v5h16v-5\"/></svg><span>Скачать JSON-копию</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-menu-row{font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;width:100%;min-height:40px;padding:8px;border:0;border-radius:8px;color:var(--ink,#182230);background:transparent;text-align:left;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;}.ds-menu-row svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;}.ds-menu-row:not(:disabled):hover{background:var(--control-hover,#f1f4f8);}.ds-menu-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#175cd3);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-menu-row:disabled{color:var(--control-disabled,#86909f);cursor:default;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Context Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Solid white, softly elevated container for disclosed settings and selection actions. The board library is a separate left sidebar up to 360px wide with 16px corners, name search, scrollable rows with 44px color/icon covers and 10px corners, per-row appearance/rename/delete actions, and a creation form below the list. The protected delete dialog uses an 18px heading. Writing/template panels use horizontal icon selectors, a compact preview, slider widths and contextual hover/focus/click help. Palette swatches use30×32px compact targets, dimensional shading and a blue tile/check selection without a dark ring. Mathematical icon choices share standard22px/2px Lucide icons. Mathematical axes show automatic/manual steps with a retained last-valid preview on invalid input.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2>Перо</h2><p>Сглаживает движения пера.<br>Применяется к следующему штриху.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,sans-serif;width:284px;padding:16px;border-radius:14px;color:var(--ink,#182230);background:var(--paper,#fff);box-shadow:var(--popover-shadow,0 6px 24px rgb(24 34 48 / 12%),0 1px 4px rgb(24 34 48 / 5%));}.ds-panel h2{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;}.ds-panel p{margin:0;color:var(--text-muted,#526176);font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Writing-First Notebook",
    "overview": "The owner-approved light writing editor uses a stable dock for the current-board chooser, tools, history, status and settings, with static branding, lower navigation and help. The dock is fixed at 778×56px with 128px board and 190px context slots from 1200px upward, two rows and 104px high at 651–1199px, and three rows and 152px high at 650px and below. A left board-library sidebar provides name search, scrollable color/icon cover rows with per-row actions, and a creation form. Lucide icons share one weight; backgrounds and last-writing navigation are configurable and predictable. Writing and template settings use compact icon selectors, dense dimensional swatches with a blue tile/check selection, contextual help and automatic axis steps with resilient manual drafts; primary desktop flows fit1280×720 without scrolling.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Light writing field with a compact floating horizontal tool dock.",
      "Inline width, contextual stabilization and restrained peripheral controls.",
      "Explicit save/error/read-only states and discoverable recovery actions.",
      "System UI typography; no external font or synthetic note in production."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Semantic State Rule",
        "body": "Keep error, selected, hover and disabled treatments distinct; do not rely on color alone to name a failure.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep the writing field dominant and preserve the out-of-flow layout.",
      "Do keep frequent controls visible and disclose secondary settings/actions contextually.",
      "Do retain visible focus, accessible names, 40px primary targets, compact palette targets and readable numeric readouts.",
      "Do preserve the pinned diagnostics exception so pressure can be observed while writing."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't import the mock's synthetic note or Caveat font into the production editor.",
      "Don't cancel pending selection work merely because a nonmodal panel opens or closes.",
      "Don't change ink geometry, document data or canvas backing dimensions as a visual styling shortcut."
    ]
  }
